  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a US$10.0 million participation in The Latin American Private Equity Fund II, L.P., a regional fund with a target capitalization of US$500 million. The fund is a Delaware limited partnership, whose aim is to invest mainly in securities of privately-held middle market growth oriented companies in Latin America. The Fund will focus on Brazil, Argentina, Mexico, and other regional countries.</narrative>
  </description>
